transactions-rbf-bump-help
=> "Replace the transaction with one paying a higher feerate to incentivize faster confirmation. New inputs may be used for the replacement transaction."
=> "用一笔支付更高费率的交易替换原交易，以促使其更快被确认。替换交易可能会使用新的输入。";;

transactions-rbf-cancel-help
=> "Replace the transaction with one paying a higher feerate that sends the coins back to your wallet. There is no guarantee the original transaction won't get mined first. New inputs may be used for the replacement transaction."
=> "用一笔支付更高费率、并把币退回你自己钱包的交易替换原交易。无法保证原交易不会先被打包。替换交易可能会使用新的输入。";;

transactions-rbf-created
=> "Replacement PSBT created successfully and ready to be signed"
=> "替换 PSBT 已成功创建，可以进行签名";;

transactions-rbf-descendants-one
=> "The following transaction is spending one or more outputs from the transaction to be replaced and will be dropped when the replacement is broadcast, along with any other transactions that depend on it:"
=> "以下交易花费了待替换交易的一个或多个输出，替换交易广播后它将被丢弃，依赖它的其他交易也会被一并丢弃：";;

transactions-rbf-descendants-some
=> "The following transactions are spending one or more outputs from the transaction to be replaced and will be dropped when the replacement is broadcast, along with any other transactions that depend on them:"
